{"timestamp": "2026-01-15 02:04:01", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-a7de05dc-1953-4315-917d-acc1ebf53596', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "user_vision": "CONTINUATION OF PREVIOUS TASK\\n\\n## Original Task\\nThe system is missing configured agents for code implementation (code_writer, development_manager). Can you verify and restore the agent configuration for code generation and project management? The current setup prevents automatic code generation and project progression.\\n\\n## Previous Question\\nThe system is missing agent definition files for development_manager and code_writer. Can you provide the necessary agent configuration files to enable code generation and project management?\\n\\n## User\'s Answer\\nAdded a new task to write these.\\n\\n## Instructions\\nThe user has answered your question above. Please continue with implementation based on their clarification. Do not ask the same question again - proceed with the approach based on their answer.",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "context": "User submitted problem via web UI"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01EdXfpnfk9HGVqoPa2aeuv9', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'Agent Configuration Restoration', 'description': 'Restore missing agent configuration files for development_manager and code_writer to enable automatic code generation and project management'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01EdXfpnfk9HGVqoPa2aeu