13 Successfully rebase branch with upstream changes\\n- \\u2713 Safely stash uncommitted changes before sync\\n- \\u2713 Detect and report conflicts clearly\\n- \\u2713 Restore stashed changes after successful sync\\n- \\u2713 Complete operations within 30 seconds for typical repositories\\n\\n## Technical Constraints\\n- Use existing base classes and configuration system\\n- Implement using Test-Driven Development (TDD)\\n- Comprehensive error handling\\n- Logging of all synchronization events\\n\\n## Out of Scope\\n- Full repository migration\\n- Complex merge conflict resolution\\n- Support for non-git version control systems\\n\\n## Assumptions\\n- Base git configuration and authentication are already set up\\n- Typical repository size is under 1GB\\n- Standard git workflow (single branch, linear history)"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_012J5u8HbEbqmiC9YcznzWDZ', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'GitHub Bots Sync Bot', 'description': 'Advanced git synchronization bot with robust branch management and error handling'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_012J5u8HbEbqmiC9YcznzWDZ', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "4f29e8cf", "message": "Created project: GitHub Bots Sync Bot", "summary": {"project_id": "4f29e8cf", "project_name": "GitHub Bots Sync Bot", "description": "Advanced git synchronization bot with robust branch management and error handling", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-15T02:07:57.556998", "updated_at": "2026-01-15T02:07:57.556998", "task_counts": {"total": 0, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 0, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-15T02:07:57.556998", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Project \'GitHub Bots Sync Bot\' created", "category": "milestone"}], "output_directory": null}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 